        "why": "In Master-Detail relationships, the child lifecycle is tightly coupled to the parent: parent deletion automatically cascades to delete all child records, child records inherit parent security, and the parent can execute real-time Roll-Up Summary calculations.",
        "explanation": "In Master-Detail relationships, the child lifecycle is tightly coupled to the parent: parent deletion automatically cascades to delete all child records, child records inherit parent security, and the parent can execute real-time Roll-Up Summary calculations."
