      "example": "A multi-billion-dollar enterprise deployed ApexRevenueOS to replace 18 fragmented SaaS platforms. The unified architecture eliminated $2.4M in annual licensing waste, reduced quote-to-cash cycle time from 22 days to 4 hours, and supported a 300% surge in enterprise transaction volume with zero downtime.",
      "code": "# ApexRevenueOS Planetary Architecture Blueprint & Topology Manifest\nimport hashlib\nimport json\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\nclass ApexRevenueOSTopology:\n    def __init__(self, enterprise_id, fiscal_year):\n        self.enterprise_id = enterprise_id\n        self.fiscal_year = fiscal_year\n        self.layers = {\n            'LAYER_1_DATA_PLANE': {'status': 'ACTIVE', 'modules': ['Event_Ingestion', 'Reverse_ETL_Hub', 'Schema_Registry']},\n            'LAYER_2_ORCHESTRATION': {'status': 'ACTIVE', 'modules': ['Fuzzy_L2A_DAG', 'Intent_Telemetry', 'ABM_Swarms']},\n            'LAYER_3_TRANSACTIONAL': {'status': 'ACTIVE', 'modules': ['ApexCPQ_Engine', 'Deal_Desk_Matrix', 'ASC606_Sync']},\n            'LAYER_4_POST_SALE_GOVERNANCE': {'status': 'ACTIVE', 'modules': ['Health_Hazard_Model', 'NRR_Whitespace', 'Crypto_Shred_Privacy']}\n        }\n        self.system_version = 'v2026.4.0-SOVEREIGN'\n        self.manifest_hash = self._generate_manifest_hash()\n\n    def _generate_manifest_hash(self):\n        payload = json.dumps(self.layers, sort_keys=True) + self.system_version\n        return hashlib.sha256(payload.encode('utf-8')).hexdigest()\n\n    def get_system_telemetry(self):\n        return {\n            'enterprise_id': self.enterprise_id,\n            'version': self.system_version,\n            'layers_active': len(self.layers),\n            'total_core_modules': sum(len(l['modules']) for l in self.layers.values()),\n            'sha256_manifest': self.manifest_hash,\n            'system_state': 'HEALTHY_SOVEREIGN'\n        }\n\nos_mesh = ApexRevenueOSTopology('APEX-GLOBAL-CORP', 'FY2027')\ntelemetry = os_mesh.get_system_telemetry()\nprint(f'System Version: {telemetry[\"version\"]}')\nprint(f'Active Core Modules: {telemetry[\"total_core_modules\"]} across {telemetry[\"layers_active\"]} layers')\nprint(f'Manifest SHA-256 Stamp: {telemetry[\"sha256_manifest\"][:24]}...')\nprint('Topology Status: All 4 enterprise layers online and cryptographically bound.')",
      "output": "System Version: v2026.4.0-SOVEREIGN\nActive Core Modules: 12 across 4 layers\nManifest SHA-256 Stamp: 15b744a80e1bb44869c9918d...\nTopology Status: All 4 enterprise layers online and cryptographically bound.",
