        "Module 4 is the Executive Boardroom Defense and Grand Viva Gatekeeper. It subjects the live platform to the ten critical enterprise stress tests\u2014evaluating commission gaming prevention, vapourware vetoes, churn cascades, privacy erasures, webhook partitions, schema drift, concession bleeding, data fences, race conditions, and cryptographic audit attestation\u2014outputting a certified board presentation package with tamper-evident SHA-256 signatures.",
